# DRUM SING DANCE PROGRAM

[Rhythm Culture's](/) Drum Sing Dance program is packed full of interactive fun while being educational and multicultural. With so many different countries, instruments and dances to choose from, we can guarantee you and your children fun and entertainment whilst learning about the amazingly diverse cultures that live in West Africa.

![](/media/2019/02/Wildlings-1389-e1550208803338.jpg)

## DRUM SING DANCE PROGRAM BENEFITS

_These benefits are all part of our Drum Sing Dance program and experienced in a fun, playful and engaging way._

**Musical**  – drumming, singing, and lots of instruments

**Physical** – dancing, coordination, spacial awareness

**Interactive** – every child has an instrument to play

**Educational** – counting, language, listening, directions

**Social** – teamwork, communication, connection, community

**Cultural** – learn about African culture through stories and play

**Creative** – thinking, playing and movement

Our Drum Sing Dance program is the best way for your children to have an exciting, interactive, and multicultural experience. Our program has five different workshops to choose from, so we have your programs and incursions covered for the entire year. Booking multiple incursions will also give you fantastic savings.

![](/media/2019/02/Wildlings-1436-e1549588253136.jpg)

WHAT HAPPENS?

-   Every child will play an African drum & unique African percussion.
-   45 - 60 minute workshop
-   There will be body percussion
-   Lots of singing, dancing & laughing
-   African dance moves
-   Call and response music patterns
-   We ask lots of questions
-   The children will go on a journey through story, song & movement
-   Learn about how and what the African instruments are made from

## GROOVERS IN GUINEA

-   Play the Djembe (hand drum)
-   Dance the BIG JUMP
-   Super fun and active
-   Speak Sousou, an African language

## IMAGINATION IN MALI

-   Journey to Bamako, Mali in West Africa
-   Hear the ancient sounds of the Balafon
-   Dance with your friends, dance with everyone!
-   Play the Tama, the drum that talks!!

## GET DOWN IN GHANA

-   Sing the the beautiful melodies of Ghana
-   Play drum solos
-   Dance the moves of Kpanlogo
-   Clap your hands and get down in Ghana!

### WEST AFRICAN DANCE RUMBLE (TRADITIONAL)

-   What's that over there?! There's a rumble in the distance!
-   Traditional dance moves
-   Dance an African story
-   Shake your shoulders and rumble those feet!

### WEST AFRICAN POP PARTY (MODERN)

-   Hear the modern sounds of West Africa
-   Dance the latest modern moves
-   Create your own African style dance moves
-   It's fun, active and the beats are pumping!

